| boundary | .        | .        | .        | .         | stone     | gem      | stone     | .        | .        | grass    | boundary |
| boundary | .        | .        | .        | .         | stone     | stone    | stone     | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
| boundary | rock     | .        | rock     | .         | .         | .        | workshop0 | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
| boundary | .        | iron     | .        | .         | .         | .        | .         | .        | wood     | rock     | boundary |
| boundary | wood     | .        | iron     | workshop1 | .         | .        | .         | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
| boundary | .        | .        | .        | .         | workshop2 | .        | iron      | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
| boundary | .        | .        | .        | .         | .         | grass    | .         | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
| boundary | .        | .        | wood     | .         | .         | .        | grass     | grass    | wood     | .        | boundary |
| boundary | rock     | .        | .        | .         | .         | .        | iron      | .        | .        | .        | boundary |
